cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or report in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: website
title: "WEA Cetacean Baseline Report"
abstract: >
  R analysis pipeline and report for summarising cetacean baseline information
  for the Wind Energy Area (WEA) study region on the Eastern Scotian Shelf.
  Combines vessel sightings from the DFO Whale Sightings Database (WSDB),
  DFO aerial survey records, and passive acoustic monitoring (PAM) detections
  to produce deduplicated sightings tables, spatial coverage and effort
  summaries, species-level sightings maps, kernel density estimate (KDE)
  rasters and contour products, and an HTML baseline report.
